    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacetle92466ed_1_1WD__RELOAD" kindref="compound">WD_RELOAD</ref> register bit definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>SPI Watchdog Counter Reload Register. The watchdog counter is decremented with fSPI,WD. If it reaches 0, SPI_WD_ERR is set and the device enters Config Mode. The register must be reloaded periodically.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Bit Map:</title><para><verbatim>* Bits 15-11: Reserved
* Bits 10-0 : WD_TIME - Reload value (11-bit)
* </verbatim></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Formula:</title><para>&lt;WD_TIME&gt; = rounddown( t_SPI_WD * f_SYS / 2^14 )</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Timeout:</title><para>t_SPI_WD = &lt;WD_TIME&gt; / f_SPI_WD</para>
</simplesect>
Default: 0x0001 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
